CI dry-run 抓到：上游 1.6.0.2 的 showStartedLiveNotification(context, courseName,
startTime, testMode) 不再带 classroom（真实路径也不传），而我 v32/v33 加的测试路径还传着
classroom = classroom → No parameter with name 'classroom' found。
测试路径与真实路径保持一致（都交给函数内部拼正文），否则两条路观感又会不一样。

(cherry picked from commit 9b4fd4d9e556d3a676c1bbfb4a7a073b2753ee3c)
---
 .../java/com/haooz/chedule/reminder/CourseReminderHelper.kt    | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/haooz/chedule/reminder/CourseReminderHelper.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/haooz/chedule/reminder/CourseReminderHelper.kt
index 6cd995af..1d792efe 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/com/haooz/chedule/reminder/CourseReminderHelper.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/com/haooz/chedule/reminder/CourseReminderHelper.kt
@@ -2364,10 +2364,11 @@ object CourseReminderHelper {
         // 测试课也要走「上课自动开启、下课自动关闭」，否则勿扰链路在测试里跑不到
         ClassDndHelper.syncTestClassDndAlarms(context)
         if (phase == ReminderTestPhase.STARTED) {
+            // 上游的 showStartedLiveNotification 已不带 classroom（真实路径也不传，正文改为
+            // 由函数内部拼；测试路径保持一致，否则两边的观感就不一样了）
             showStartedLiveNotification(
                 context = context,
                 courseName = courseName,
-                classroom = classroom,
                 startTime = startTime,
                 testMode = true
             )
